{
  "label": "christmas7",
  "title_zh": "",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label christmas7:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene lastchristmas1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/lastchristmas1.webp",
      "alt": "lastchristmas1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I come bearing news.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What kind of news? What’s going on?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We are under attack.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Excuse me?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The sky is exploding.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": There are so many bright colors.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I wanted to tell you I love you before we die.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Those are called fireworks and they’re used to celebrate holidays. We’re not going to die.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well this is awkward.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You don’t...actually love me. Right?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is love the feeling you get when you want to feed someone noodles until they grow large and powerful?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": In your case? Probably.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Then I am in love with the whole class.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How will I ever fund this wedding?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is there any other reason you came up here? Or was it really just to seek shelter from some harmless, brightly colored lights?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I was told to bring you downstairs.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I had assumed it was because someone wanted you dead, but I no longer think this on account of the fireworks.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well thank you for coming up to execute me.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Merry Christmas. Now die.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, I’m going to have to pass.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene lastchristmas2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/lastchristmas2.webp",
      "alt": "lastchristmas2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": A joke.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s okay if you stay alive.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That might be the nicest thing you’ve ever said to me.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re even smiling and everything.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": My face feels strange.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is this what they call Christmas Spirit?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Nope. Like I said, that’s a smile.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You should do it more often. You look cute when you’re actually emoting.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene lastchristmas3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/lastchristmas3.webp",
      "alt": "lastchristmas3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This is the first holiday I have ever spent with girls my age plus one older man.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It was so enjoyable that I will not smile again until next Christmas.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I must preserve these feelings as if they were pickled garlic.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Weird metaphor but sure, do whatever you want.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you coming back downstairs with me?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene lastchristmas4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/lastchristmas4.webp",
      "alt": "lastchristmas4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": To the war-zone?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Again, it’s not a war-zone.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are we not currently engaged in a space war?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How can you be sure the explosions are not coming from that?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Because this happens several times every year. It’s a celebration.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene lastchristmas5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/lastchristmas5.webp",
      "alt": "lastchristmas5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": War is no reason to celebrate, bro.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Something bad is going to happen and you will be too busy using all of your smiles to prepare for it.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Don’t say ominous things like “Something bad is going to happen.” Do you know how many red flags it raises when someone like you does that?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene lastchristmas1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/lastchristmas1.webp",
      "alt": "lastchristmas1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t have a flag.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That was-",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": A joke, I know. It wasn’t a good one.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well they can’t all be award-winners, you bastard.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": One would be nice.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Knock-knock.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene lastchristmas6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/lastchristmas6.webp",
      "alt": "lastchristmas6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Mn...",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I was prepared for you to say “Who’s there?”",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The Emerald Guardian did not train me on what to say in the event of an emergency like this.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m going downstairs now, Tsuneyo.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "if futabalust10 == True:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I turn to the bathroom and shout at the door, wondering if Futaba will be finished cleaning me off of her clothes any time soon.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "else:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I turn to the bathroom and shout at the door, wondering if Futaba will be finished any time soon.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ll be outside whenever you finish in there.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh...okay! Just give me a...few more minutes.",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sensei, you have not heard the rest of my joke.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Please finish this job so that I may rest in peace.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Will finishing the joke kill you?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No, but it is sure to kill you.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": With humor.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Who’s there?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene lastchristmas1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/lastchristmas1.webp",
      "alt": "lastchristmas1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Tsuneyo Tojo, soup warrior.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s it? That’s the joke?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Unexpected, wasn’t it?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It is what the Emerald Guardian calls an “anti-joke.”",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I am so bad at being funny that I must now be purposely not funny when using comedy.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This is what my life has become.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Can I leave now?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The war. And other things.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ll be fine...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Okay, but don’t come crying to me when you die.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I will be sure not to...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I need to step around Tsuneyo, who adamantly refuses to move for some reason.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I’m not sure why she was being so weird, but-",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Wait, what am I talking about? She’s always weird. This is no different from talking to a bird or...pulling a knife on me in a restaurant.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "If anything, being afraid of fireworks is even...less weird.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I mean, look at Miku. She’s probably tucked away in some private room right now having her head rubbed by her best friend.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Maybe Futaba will be generous enough to rub Tsuneyo’s head when she comes out of the bathroom.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "That might be beneficial for all of us.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ".........",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "......",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I walk out to find the charred bodies of all of my students, burnt to a crisp from space-explosions that found their way to Kumon-mi.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I pray for each and every one of them and then toss their bodies into the ocean.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "They decompose and feed a grand total of 6,743 fish over the course of their time in the water.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The fish are then captured and eaten by humans.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Then eventually wind up back in the ground and grow into beautiful, tall trees.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene lastchristmas7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/lastchristmas7.webp",
      "alt": "lastchristmas7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Just kidding.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I walk past Rin and Maya and make my way over to Ami, who starts frantically waving at me the second the stray light of the fireworks hits my slightly-thicker winter shirt.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yay! You made it!",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I was only like, two minutes away. Of course I made it.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why didn’t you come out as soon as we heard the first bang? You love fireworks.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We always used to watch them together at all the festivals and stuff. Remember how you’d always let me sit on your shoulders?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you want to sit on my shoulders now? Is that what’s going on?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes please!",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why? Literally no one will care.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I can name at least eleven other girls who probably would.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene lastchristmas8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/lastchristmas8.webp",
      "alt": "lastchristmas8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But I’m the main girl. Even if hearing that would break Molly’s little Irish heart into like seven trillion pieces.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Where is Molly anyway?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, she got really upset when Rin yelled at her and stormed off to go play games in the bathroom.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s just what she does when she gets all sad and stuff.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I wish that worked for me. I just cry and eat instant noodles until I feel better.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, that’s a much more adult way of handling your problems.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How is Rin taking it?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Rin? She’s fine. I think she was just surprised.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Also, Ayane is dead now. I murdered her and dumped her body behind the hotel.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Please don’t go looking for her.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s a pretty intense reaction to just a kiss- especially with someone you’ve kissed before.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene lastchristmas9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/lastchristmas9.webp",
      "alt": "lastchristmas9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This again?! I thought I just misheard you before.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I have no idea what you’re talking about. Why would Ayane and me have ever done something like that?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait, are you being serious?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Of course. When have I ever lied to you?",
      "spk": "Ami",
